Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=1}========================CHAPTERS AND OPENINGS=====================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:00:12.42,0:00:15.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AKAINU]\NI bet you're\Noh-so happy, Issho.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:15.76,0:00:17.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've been pushing\Nfor this forever.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, you got your wish!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:19.63,0:00:22.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Seven Warlords\Nhave been abolished.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:22.26,0:00:24.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know I stood\Nfirmly against it!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:24.85,0:00:26.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But when the guys at\Nthe top make the call,
Dialogue: 50,0:00:26.89,0:00:28.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there's no reversin' it!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:28.68,0:00:31.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They should know that\Njustice comes with a price tag.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:31.19,0:00:33.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who do you think is\Npaying that price?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:33.31,0:00:34.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take a step back!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:36.52,0:00:40.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A pity. Still can't see\Nthe bigger picture, can you?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:40.40,0:00:42.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's 'cause you've never been\None of the innocent folks
Dialogue: 50,0:00:42.49,0:00:45.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,this cruel world has\Nchewed up and spit out.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:45.41,0:00:49.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Happens every day\Nto good people.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:49.66,0:00:52.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! We don't have time!\NKeep moving!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:06.68,0:01:09.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Seven Warlords\Nare now no more.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:09.77,0:01:11.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Things are gonna\Nget a bit rocky,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:11.39,0:01:15.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so we'll need to put our trust\Nin our Special Science Group.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:17.02,0:01:18.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The power balance\Nin this world is
Dialogue: 50,0:01:18.73,0:01:22.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,about to be turned\Ncompletely upside down.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:23.11,0:01:27.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not the only thing\Nupside down right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:27.41,0:01:29.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Word has it that\NKaido and Big Mom
Dialogue: 50,0:01:29.91,0:01:32.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,are joining forces in Wano.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:32.08,0:01:34.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FUJITORA]\NHm? That can't be!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:36.13,0:01:39.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FUJITORA]\NThe legendary\NRocks Pirates have returned?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:39.76,0:01:41.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 50,0:01:46.18,0:01:48.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AKAINU]\NNothing "legendary"\Nabout this mess.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:48.47,0:01:50.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's as real as it gets.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:50.26,0:01:53.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it's our problem\Nto deal with.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.44,0:01:56.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, they don't\Ncare how busy we are.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.48,0:01:59.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're just the latest\Nfiasco on our plate!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.32,0:02:05.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE C]\NTwo Emperors\Nof the Sea teamed up?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.45,0:02:06.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.54,0:02:08.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're really\Npulling this right now?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.58,0:02:09.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BRANNEW]\NWell, technically speaking,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.87,0:02:13.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the intel reports they're\N"about to" unite.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.42,0:02:15.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's been no damages\Nas of this moment,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.59,0:02:17.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but we don't understand\Ntheir motives
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.17,0:02:19.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or how to handle this yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.13,0:02:23.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We only have a single detail\Nconfirmed at this current time.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.01,0:02:25.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They both hail from\Nthe notorious Rocks Pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.68,0:02:27.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Marines gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.22,0:02:32.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though actual details on the\NRocks crew are fairly sparse.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.27,0:02:33.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Mom and Kaido have been
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.73,0:02:36.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,at odds with one\Nanother for ages.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.15,0:02:38.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, this is coming\Nout of left field.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.11,0:02:40.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't say I could've\Npredicted this one.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.65,0:02:43.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I may, who are\Nthe Rocks Pirates?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.36,0:02:45.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NAh, of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.37,0:02:46.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't know\Nmuch about them
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.70,0:02:49.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,since they came\Nlong before your time.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.90,0:02:51.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NThe Rocks Pirates were a gang of
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.66,0:02:53.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,extremely dangerous individuals
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.82,0:02:57.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who came together on\Nthe Pirate Island of Fullalead.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.33,0:02:59.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their entire allegiance\Nwas founded
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.70,0:03:02.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in order to make one big score.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.46,0:03:08.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NThey were such\Na vicious bunch of scoundrels
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.76,0:03:11.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that they'd often kill\Ntheir own crewmates.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.30,0:03:18.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NCaptain Rocks' lineup\Nconsisted of many heavy hitters.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.18,0:03:22.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NThis included Whitebeard...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.15,0:03:27.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\N...Big Mom...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.07,0:03:30.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\N...and Kaido.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.90,0:03:33.91,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,[Marines chattering]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.91,0:03:36.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know that it's hard\Nto believe, but trust me.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.70,0:03:39.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They were all once a part\Nof the same pirate crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.33,0:03:39.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[Marines gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.54,0:03:41.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MARINES]\N– What?!\N– What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.42,0:03:44.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.50,0:03:46.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can hardly\Nbelieve that's true!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.54,0:03:48.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amazingly enough,\Nthose three weren't
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.46,0:03:50.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the only crew members\Nwho went on
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.34,0:03:52.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to make a name for themselves.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.59,0:03:55.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just as an example, some of\Ntheir other prestigious members
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.18,0:03:59.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,included Shiki the Golden Lion,\Nthe Silver Axe,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.93,0:04:01.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain John, and Wang Zhi.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.98,0:04:05.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously? All those maniacs\Nwere on the same crew
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.15,0:04:06.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and they didn't\Nwipe each other out?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.35,0:04:09.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But how can this story\Nbe lost to history?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.44,0:04:12.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If they hated their crewmates\Nthat much, well,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.19,0:04:15.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they wouldn't want\Nto tell their tale.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.03,0:04:19.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Back then, Captain Rocks\Nwas fighting to be
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.03,0:04:21.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"King of the World."
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.92,0:04:32.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NThey were openly\Nhostile to the Government.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.17,0:04:35.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They should have been\Nconsidered terrorists.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.01,0:04:36.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But many of their incidents\Nwere covered up
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.88,0:04:38.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because the truth\Nwas discomforting
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.68,0:04:41.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and made us look weak.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.18,0:04:44.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not that it mattered,\Nbut when they ruled the seas,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.39,0:04:47.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,everyone was well aware\Nof the threat they posed.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.19,0:04:47.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Marines gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.69,0:04:49.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then the news broke out.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.11,0:04:52.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,980)}The God Valley incident,\Njust 38 years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.90,0:04:55.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}According to the reports,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.41,0:04:58.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}the fiercest crew in the world,\Nthe Rocks Pirates,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.58,0:05:02.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}had been completely\Nannihilated on that island.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.62,0:05:05.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Marines scream]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.25,0:05:12.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Rock Pirates yell]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.78,0:05:35.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Marines cheer]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.78,0:05:38.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NThat rampaging force of evil
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.57,0:05:40.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that no one was\Nable to stop before
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.91,0:05:45.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,had been crushed by the\NNavy Vice Admiral Garp.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.87,0:05:49.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His name soon reached\Nthe ends of the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.63,0:05:55.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That day he became known as\N"The great hero of the Navy"!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.88,0:05:57.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I knew he was a badass,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.38,0:05:59.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I never heard\Nhow he got that title.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.51,0:06:04.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's more than earned it!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.31,0:06:06.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE N]\NI've heard\Na hundred tales of heroism
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.10,0:06:08.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,about Vice Admiral Garp.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.14,0:06:11.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe such an\Nimportant one went unnoticed.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.69,0:06:14.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's really taken on\Nall the bigshot pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.19,0:06:16.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And he won, no less!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.07,0:06:22.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[sighs]\NBig Mom and Kaido\Nhave allied with each other?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.83,0:06:27.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When can we catch a break?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.54,0:06:28.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NYou haven't heard much because
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.83,0:06:31.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the man himself\Nrefuses to talk about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.34,0:06:33.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE O]\NWhy's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.20,0:06:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if he doesn't like it much,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.50,0:06:38.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you so the tale\Nisn't lost to history.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.21,0:06:39.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There were two reasons why this
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.54,0:06:41.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,was never reported\Nto the presses.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.92,0:06:44.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The first being he had to\Nwork alongside pirates
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.88,0:06:47.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in order to win the battle.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.05,0:06:49.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(712.5,1053)}– [Marines gasp]\N– Are you joking?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.22,0:06:50.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not everything.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.68,0:06:53.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He protected the Celestial\NDragons in doing so.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.64,0:06:55.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(479,1053)}– [Marines gasp]\N– [MARINE H] Hang on a moment!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.72,0:06:58.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How do they\Ntie into all of this?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.02,0:07:03.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.40,0:07:06.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't it the Navy's duty\Nto keep them safe though?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.19,0:07:08.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't see a problem!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.53,0:07:10.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NIt's Garp's own moral compass
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.28,0:07:12.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that tells him otherwise.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.35,0:07:14.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NA major reason why\Nhe's refused the promotion
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.81,0:07:16.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to Admiral stems from\Nthe fact that it would
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.90,0:07:20.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,place him directly under\Nthe Celestial Dragon's command.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.86,0:07:22.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's his accomplishments\Nand reputation
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.78,0:07:26.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that prevent him from being\Ndismissed for insubordination.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.82,0:07:28.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brace yourself\Nfor the next part.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.91,0:07:31.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Garp had to act quickly to\Nprotect the Celestial Dragons
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.95,0:07:33.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and their slaves at God Valley.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.83,0:07:37.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With no other options left,\Nhe joined forces with Roger.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.08,0:07:38.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Together, they pooled\Ntheir numbers
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.75,0:07:41.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to defeat the Rocks Pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.17,0:07:44.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is the truth of\Nthe God Valley Incident.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.51,0:07:47.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Marines gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.55,0:07:48.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like Gold Roger ?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.72,0:07:49.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King of the Pirates?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.76,0:07:51.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They fought together?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.18,0:07:54.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Celestial Dragons, Gold Roger,\Nand the Rocks Pirates?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.52,0:07:56.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You listed off\Nso many big names!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.85,0:07:59.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hard to believe all those people\Nwere there at the same time!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.82,0:08:03.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How have I not even heard of\Nthis God Valley place?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.65,0:08:06.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no surprise there.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.07,0:08:10.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)}[SENGOKU]\NLook for it on a modern-day map.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.87,0:08:14.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(439,0)}You won't find that\Nisland's name anywhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.21,0:08:18.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NFor good reason, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.67,0:08:21.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It disappeared without a trace.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.46,0:08:25.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Marines gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.22,0:08:27.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NThe Government\Nwanted to hide what happened
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.09,0:08:30.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,on that island and\Nthey made it disappear.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.30,0:08:34.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Knowing this, do you still\Nwant to hear more of the story?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.43,0:08:37.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the end, Rocks was thwarted\Nby his own ambition.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.48,0:08:39.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He broke one too many taboos.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.56,0:08:41.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The tales of his heinous crimes
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.02,0:08:42.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,were deemed unfit\Nfor the public,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.69,0:08:46.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and so he came to exist\Nonly in legend.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.15,0:08:46.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.70,0:08:49.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is a legacy that only\Nlingers in the memories
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.03,0:08:52.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of a few old Marines\Nfrom my generation.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.24,0:08:55.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's hard to imagine it.\NI know this was years ago,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.41,0:08:56.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it's crazy to think one man\Nled three of the Four Emperors.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.00,0:08:57.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[REVOLUTIONARY D]\NCrazy to think one of the
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.26,0:08:58.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Four Emperors is down.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.25,0:09:02.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Rocks was\NGold Roger's very first enemy
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.09,0:09:05.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and perhaps his\Ngreatest one, as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.09,0:09:07.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That aside, there was\Nsomething very interesting
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.38,0:09:09.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that those two had in common.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.93,0:09:11.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though it was rarely spoken,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.34,0:09:14.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rocks' full name was\NRocks D. Xebec.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.81,0:09:17.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He had a special trait\Nsome pirates share.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.31,0:09:19.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That being the "D." initial.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.23,0:09:22.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1060)}Although, he is no longer\Nalive to speak of it.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.39,0:09:40.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NIt's true that\NKaido and Big Mom were
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.35,0:09:43.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,once shipmates under\Nthe same captain.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.85,0:09:46.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, that was 38 years ago,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.56,0:09:49.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and they were nothing like\Nthey are at the present.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.48,0:09:51.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the intel that we\Nreceived is accurate,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.52,0:09:52.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then this would be the birth of
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.74,0:09:55.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the most dangerous\Npirate crew in the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.61,0:09:57.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, Brannew,\Nwhy don't you tell us
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.32,0:09:59.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,what everyone's\Nbounties will be.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.70,0:10:01.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With pleasure, but keep in mind
Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.28,0:10:03.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that we'll have to go back\Nto the drawing board
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.08,0:10:04.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,on the bounties\Nfor the Warlords,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.70,0:10:07.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,since they've had their\Nimmunity stripped away.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.16,0:10:08.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As for the other big shots,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.42,0:10:11.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we can go over\Ntheir numbers easily.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.16,0:10:18.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.93,0:10:23.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's start with the\Nnewest Emperor of the Sea
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.02,0:10:25.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who attained his title\Nabout a year ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.52,0:10:27.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you know.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.94,0:10:29.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He gained popularity\Nafter his assault
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.94,0:10:32.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,on Impel Down two years back.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.27,0:10:34.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now occupying the\NPirate Island Fullalead,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.90,0:10:38.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he continues to expand\Nhis territory and influence
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.03,0:10:41.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(4067,0,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}while filling the void that\NWhitebeard left behind.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.41,0:10:45.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BRANNEW]\NCommodore of\Nthe Blackbeard Pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.66,0:10:52.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marshall D. Teach!\N2,247,600,000 berries!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.17,0:10:55.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Marines gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.80,0:10:58.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As for the next bounty.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.42,0:11:01.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This man has been\Nan Emperor for six years now.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.68,0:11:03.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's the youngest of the four
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.97,0:11:06.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and deeply admired\Nby his subordinates,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.35,0:11:08.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,whom you probably have heard of.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.94,0:11:13.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beckman. Roux. Yasopp.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.11,0:11:15.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Each with a high\Naverage bounty themselves,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.53,0:11:17.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(5526,0,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}this pirate crew is\Nworld renowned for
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.32,0:11:19.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(5526,0,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}having an excellent\Nbalance of skills.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.82,0:11:22.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(5526,0,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}There really are\Nno weaklings amongst them.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.24,0:11:27.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The chief of the Red-Hair\NPirates, Red-Haired Shanks!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.16,0:11:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's set at\N4,048,900,000 berries!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.38,0:11:35.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Marines gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.96,0:11:38.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now let's move on.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.17,0:11:39.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She was born a monster,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.55,0:11:42.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who allegedly destroyed\Nan entire village of Giants
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.22,0:11:45.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in Elbaph when she\Nwas just a child.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.18,0:11:48.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're not one of\Nher 85 children,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.81,0:11:50.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or at least related by blood,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.39,0:11:53.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you will naturally be\Nmistrusted by her.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.23,0:11:55.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's the undisputed\NQueen of the sweet-themed
Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.61,0:11:58.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2022,0,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}network of islands\Nknown as Totto Land!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.61,0:12:02.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BRANNEW]\NThat is of course the\Ncaptain of the Big Mom Pirates,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.99,0:12:04.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Charlotte Linlin!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.45,0:12:08.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's worth\N4,388,000,000 berries!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.41,0:12:11.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Marines gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.71,0:12:14.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finally, we have\Na monster who made
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.84,0:12:17.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a name for himself\Nearly on in life.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.96,0:12:21.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This man was only an apprentice\Nwhen he joined the Rocks crew.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.80,0:12:25.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BRANNEW]\NHe won the respect of\Nthe most ferocious of pirates
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.64,0:12:27.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,through his sheer strength alone
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.56,0:12:32.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2773,0,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}until he was worthy of earning\Nthe title Emperor of the Sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.98,0:12:36.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BRANNEW]\NSupreme Commander\Nof the Beast Pirates,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.44,0:12:43.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido, King of the Beasts,\Nworth 4,611,100,000 berries!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.62,0:12:49.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How distressing.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.00,0:12:51.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, it goes without saying,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.12,0:12:53.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but they decided at the Reverie
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.25,0:12:58.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that we will no longer have\Nthe Warlords at our disposal.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.42,0:13:01.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.67,0:13:04.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Only time will tell\Nif distancing ourselves
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.22,0:13:06.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,was a good decision or not.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.39,0:13:07.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll have to wait and see how
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.80,0:13:11.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the Navy's Special Science Team,\Nthe S.G., performs.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.18,0:13:14.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since we're here,\NI'll put this in perspective.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.56,0:13:18.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I might as well share the\Nbounties of some other legends.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.69,0:13:22.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BRANNEW]\NThe captain of\Nthe Whitebeard Pirates,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.57,0:13:24.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Edward Newgate!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.66,0:13:28.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,5,046,000,000 berries!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.66,0:13:34.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BRANNEW]\NThe captain\Nof the Roger Pirates,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.79,0:13:37.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the King of the Pirates,\NGold Roger!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.58,0:13:42.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,5,564,800,000!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.83,0:13:48.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BRANNEW]\NThere hasn't been\Na bounty to surpass these two.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.54,0:13:52.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At least not yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.59,0:13:57.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BRANNEW]\NBut if Big Mom\Nand Kaido form their alliance,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.30,0:13:58.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,their combined bounty will be
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.59,0:14:00.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the highest the world\Nhas ever seen,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.51,0:14:03.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the size of their\Ncrew will be huge.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.54,0:14:06.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BRANNEW]\NI've read the reports.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.83,0:14:09.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is happening\Nas we speak in Wano.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.21,0:14:12.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BRANNEW]\NFleet Admiral Sakazuki!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.92,0:14:15.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We won't be getting\Ninvolved with that.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.13,0:14:18.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Marines gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.01,0:14:19.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In case you went senile,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.51,0:14:21.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we lack the manpower\Nand resources
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.38,0:14:23.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to handle this currently!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.39,0:14:25.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Any questions?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.27,0:14:35.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,None. I never intended\Nto get involved anyway.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.82,0:14:38.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This old man was simply\Nproviding these young soldiers
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.49,0:14:41.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with some wisdom and experience.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.74,0:14:49.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NAt the end of the day,\Npirates are humans.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.00,0:14:51.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They have their own\Nrelationships and reasons.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.79,0:14:55.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't take action\Nwithout knowing their history.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.75,0:14:57.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.26,0:15:00.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There was a pirate from Wano\Nwho Whitebeard was fond of.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.34,0:15:03.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was favored by Roger\Nand Red-Hair.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.84,0:15:07.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Marines gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.43,0:15:10.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AKAINU]\NYou mean\NKozuki Oden, don't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.31,0:15:11.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The man who served\Nas a commander
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.73,0:15:14.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,on Whitebeard's ship long ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.23,0:15:17.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,None other, of course.\NAnd that's not all he did.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.98,0:15:19.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The King of the Pirates\Nrecruited him
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.65,0:15:21.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for his final journey.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.61,0:15:23.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something's not adding up.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.16,0:15:26.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While I can't imagine Oden\Nbeing connected, it seems odd.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.99,0:15:30.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AKAINU]\NHm?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.83,0:15:33.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NDoesn't it make you question why
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.33,0:15:35.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,all these huge players\Nhave such close ties
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.88,0:15:39.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2393,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}to an isolated country\Nlike the Land of Wano?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.18,0:15:44.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NI can't believe\Nit's coincidence.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.55,0:15:49.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'd do well to keep\Nyour eyes open, Sakazuki.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=4}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
